1. Apply timelock checks to all entry points
2. Verify msg.sender in implementation, not just proxy
3. Disable delegatecall for timelocked functions
4. Use explicit function calls instead of delegatecall

Example:
modifier onlyTimelock() {
require(msg.sender == address(timelock), "Not timelock");
require(address(this) == implementation, "No delegatecall");
_;
}

